siness_summary":"Krishana Phoschem Limited engages in the manufacture and sale of fertilizers and chemicals under the Annadata and Bharat brands in India. It provides beneficiated rock phosphate, single super phosphate (SSP), di-ammonium phosphate, granulated SSP, intermediate dyes, sulphuric acid, phosphoric acid, oleum, phospho gypsum, liquid SO3, chloro sulphonic acid, water-soluble fertilizers, micronutrients, supplements, and organic products; secondary nutrients; and nitrogen, phosphorus, and potassium complex fertilizers. The company also engages in the contract manufacturing of chemicals. It sells its products to retailers, distributors, and traders. The company was incorporated in 2004 and is based in Bhilwara, India. Krishana Phoschem Limited is a subsidiary of Ostwal Phoschem (India) Limited."}}